WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:28.070
During a battle between the 
Solo Ship and Moonland troops,

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.830
Gije Zaral saved Sheryl's life.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:38.080
Meanwhile, the attack of the Adigo 
Mobile Mechas and the Geru Field

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.260
brought the Ideon to the verge of defeat.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.460
Beams of light that extended from the Ideon's wrists

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.170
turned the situation around in the blink of an eye.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:56.480
<b>The Desperate Sniper</b>

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.670
This planet won't be a problem.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.840
It's only the first step in our
strategy to lure the Giant.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.200
We'll surround the Giant near the surface,

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.180
and if it comes down to it,
 we'll seize it with a Freezer attack.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.520
Do you think this will work out?

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.560
There's no choice but to try.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:35.570
The Giant's cannon and its shining swords...

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:41.220
They're both too powerful to be used
 on a planet inhabited by it's own people.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.740
So that's that's the advantage we've got.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.310
If you'll give me permission, I'd like to help.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:54.050
If you're okay using a Galbo Jick with a broken
Geru generator, I'll lend it to you.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.560
Yes. All I'd like for payment is some drinking money.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:58.960
How shrewd.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.260
Now to see if the Logo Dau aliens show up...

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.490
It looks like the Buff Clan has moved
 to the opposite side of Earth.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.870
Isn't this our chance to escape?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.670
That would be a selfish thing to do.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.040
Why's that?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.890
What if they're only trying to distract us?

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.890
Are you saying it's a diversionary tactic?

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.000
I agree with Cosmo.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.750
From a humane standpoint, I'd like to help Earth...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:40.670
I understand, but...

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:41.170
Bes!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:46.020
A rescue signal has been sent from the
 Earth Union's N District Headquarters.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.640
What should we do?

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.630
We need to fight.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.360
If we want to change the Earth's attitude towards us,

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.350
we should attack the Buff Clan now.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.130
Otherwise, we'll be left without any aid.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.190
But those Ideon swords that
came from it's wrists...

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.650
We don't know how to control them!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.520
The Ideon still has the Wave Leader Gun.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.700
That's only been used once.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:09.330
But...!

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:13.730
Things that we can't control are
no good as weapons, Cosmo.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.500
What was it that we learned from Gloria?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.520
It seems that the Ide reacts
in response to self-defense...

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:25.100
Never mind that! We have to decide 
whether we're going to help the Earth or not!

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.360
We've escaped the Moon's gravitational field!

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.070
There's no time to argue! What do we do?

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.740
All right, head to Earth!

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.430
We'll keep our conscience clean.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.750
Cosmo? I haven't seem him.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.050
He wouldn't be here when it's time to sortie.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.870
Oh, right. Sorry for bothering you.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:53.830
Keep up the good work.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:58.210
I'll be back in a second.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:21.990
Can you eat it?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:30.400
It tastes like the fruit we call "etora". Thank you.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.120
What's wrong?

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.790
It's not poisoned.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.550
I don't even care.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:50.120
I'm even willing to accept pity 
from my enemies to see the Ide.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.080
This obsession of mine is miserable.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.580
Who is in there?

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.200
Please tell me, Gije.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.960
How does the Buff Clan view the Ide energy?

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:17.750
It's an accumulation of the will of several
 billion people from the Sixth Civilization.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.210
Is it will power?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.870
No, that's not all.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.930
I think that the Ide is absorbing
our own will power as well.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:29.090
Yes. Otherwise, the Ideon wouldn't have moved at all.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.710
After it was discovered that those mysterious
particles I discovered on Logo Dau

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:37.220
have an effect on human thought...

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.370
They came up with the Geru Field strategy...

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:46.580
But the Ideon has begun to put up a barrier
that's capable of withstanding even that.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:50.380
It seems like the Ideon's power is
 rising far too much. Why is that?

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.240
I don't know.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.440
Are you talking about the Ideon Wave Leader
Gun and those glowing swords?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.040
Why have they appeared all of a sudden?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.630
Because the fighting has gotten so fierce lately.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.100
No, that's not it.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.480
It's because the crew's desire to defend
themselves has increased.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.260
So the presence of a baby with
 a strong self preservation instinct...

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:22.280
Yes. We should get Piper Lou aboard
the Ideon and watch what happens.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:27.220
We hadn't taken the baby into account.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:28.870
You think he's related to this?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:29.890
Yes.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:30.740
I get it.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:32.740
Lou and the Ide...?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:37.450
Lotta!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:38.700
Sheryl!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:41.090
You...

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.070
Yes. Go ahead and tell everyone.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.430
But let me just tell you one thing.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:53.700
To understand the power of Ide, it may
 be necessary to have Gije Zaral on board.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:56.590
Don't forget that.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:02.130
I'm the girl who tried to kill Karala! You trust me?

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:05.010
That doesn't matter anymore.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:13.610
I don't care if I live or die.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.030
My life is in your hands.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.160
Buff...

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:19.700
Buff Clan!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:25.540
But won't you hide me for a while, like Sheryl said?

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:29.400
No way... I can't make that decision!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.850
If we keep going this way, we'll
 end up bumping into the Buff Clan!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.570
This is the aliens' home planet.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.040
They've got a considerable
 number of troops in the sea and sky.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.730
We've detected something penetrating the orbit!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.620
I think it's the Logo Dau ship!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.670
Just as I planned.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:13.630
All squadrons! Spread out and
 ambush the Logo Dau Giant!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.880
NS 5006 has been sunk!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:21.360
The enemy is breaking through
our last defense line!

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.260
Return fire with interceptor missiles!

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.470
Aerial defense squad, hurry!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.450
Lou, Lou!

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.560
Lou, want to come with me?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:43.580
Lou!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.240
Lou, this is an important matter.
You need to lend your power.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:53.540
Lou, please.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.300
You can't force him.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:56.130
Lotta...

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:58.930
Why do you need Lou?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.010
To save us all.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.080
Will you explain afterwards?

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.940
If I had the time, I'd do it right now.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.520
Lou, let Sheryl take care of you.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:11.900
Thanks, Lou.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.040
Lotta, I'm going aboard the Ideo-Delta.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.400
Stay safe.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.700
The Buff Clan's battle strength is high!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.120
We'll be fighting battleships.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.200
Ideon units, dock right after launching!

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.710
Use the Wave Leader Gun!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.160
Sheryl? We're about to launch!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.420
Sorry!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:43.570
I have to confirm the connection
 with Lou and the Ideon Gauge.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.400
There are some spare space suits behind you.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:47.680
Huh?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.810
Yes.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.100
Here they are.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:51.680
Ideon units, launch!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.480
Roger! Ideo-Delta, launching!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.410
Sol-Vanier, launching!

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.470
We should really have abandoned the Earth!

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:02.930
Drop it already, Moera.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.220
You like fighting, don't you?

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.190
Who would fight only for fun?!

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:09.430
Fate is ours to create!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.360
I won't be controlled by this Ide nonsense!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.180
Ideon will head for the enemy warships!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:35.010
Deck, keep an eye on the Ideon Gauge.

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.480
We'll use the Wave Leader Gun right away!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.700
Their main force is four warships!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.930
We don't know the amount of
 fighters and Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:46.790
Okay! We'll cover the Ideon.

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:51.800
Main cannon! Missiles! To create a diversion,
 volley firing for 30 seconds!

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:52.520
Fire!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.900
Here come the Giant machines!

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:21.940
We're going after the Giant!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:22.490
Yes sir!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.920
There's no telling what will happen!
Approach them from behind!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:33.710
The Ideon Gauge?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.080
The power is going up! Check all energy circuits!

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.050
The accelerator is okay!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.300
Galvanization, okay!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.170
Oscillation lined up!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:45.510
85 percent, all good! Ideon Gun, set!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.510
Targeting the enemy ships!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:54.880
I've got them!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:55.730
Cosmo!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.270
Is it okay to fire so close to the surface?

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:06.070
It should be... There's less power
 than the last time we used it.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.910
The Giant has stopped! Volley fire!

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:17.330
Fire!

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:40.560
The power's still too strong!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.120
Cosmo!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.000
It wasn't a direct hit!

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:03.190
And yet, the Wave Leader Gun...

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.300
Damn you!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.100
It sank four battleships at once?!

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:19.850
Accursed giant...

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:25.870
All units, pull back! I'm using the Freezer on the Giant!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.160
Freezer Skatch?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:33.410
That Rukuku! She's going to use a Freezer attack?!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.200
These aren't missiles! What are they?!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.080
They launched it too early!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.480
You need to take out the Giant's cannon first!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.740
Did you lose your cool along
 with the battleships, Rukuku?!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.670
They caught it? The Freezer attack is working?

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:16.740
What the!?

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.160
The temperature is going down!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.580
The Ideon being frozen!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.280
This is nothing yet!

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:29.420
Lou?! Are you alright?! Don't be frightened!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.140
Damn it, what should I do?!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.750
How surprising, it's more
 potent than the Geru Field...

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:43.610
We'll capture the Giant once it's frozen.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.770
In a matter of seconds, the pilots will be dead.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.440
Easier than expected...

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.620
Lou?! Piper Lou!?

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:01.040
Hold on, Lou! Hold on!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:07.760
All because you had to bring Lou here...

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.850
All right! Recover the Giant!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.610
The Logo Dau alien ship is closing in on us!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.780
Never mind! We'll engage them with our fleet!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:29.980
The Giant...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:35.740
Retreat! Retreat!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.070
The Giant's cannon...

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.410
It's still firing!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.770
What was that?!

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:08.680
Did they adjust the power of the Giant's cannon?

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.360
Concentrate fire on the ascending enemy ships!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:15.990
This is our chance to sink them!

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:23.080
Our plan has failed! All units, retreat!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.390
Deck! Wake up! Wake up!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:37.090
We still can't control the power of the Ideon Gun.

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.050
We can't use it!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.830
It's the headache Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:40.680
What should we do?!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:48.390
Go down!

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:53.150
Don't fall for it! The Giant is coming from behind!

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:03.530
That Giant can't be allowed to exist!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.430
You've been defeated!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.340
If the pilots are still alive,
 come out and raise your arms!

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:25.770
I won't kill you!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.650
Pilot of the Giant! Listen to me!

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.520
Sir Daram!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.510
Don't stop me!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:39.080
After losing the battle I wagered my
 pride on, I ask you for one last chance!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.470
I don't care if you ridicule me! Come down and fight!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:47.430
Come down?

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:52.630
A duel?

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.000
Make him stop that nonsense!

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.670
Cosmo is fighting one of the Buff Clan in a duel!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.340
Cosmo!?

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.260
At this time?!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:04.560
Wait!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:05.650
Hurry up! We're going to miss it!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.330
It's all going according to plan!

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:22.740
You're open!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:24.490
Sir Daram!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.200
Cosmo!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.240
If it looks like Cosmo's going to lose, I'll shoot!

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:34.500
Stop!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.380
Stop it, Cosmo!

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:40.760
It ends now!

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:43.060
Stop it, alien!

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.430
Sir Daram's spacesuit has...

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:47.010
You bastard! It's too late!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.410
There's a nuclear bomb on it!

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.750
If you even graze him slightly, we're all going to die!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.070
What?!

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.150
We'll die together!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.780
Sorry, I had to act on my impulses.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.100
It's alright.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.140
You bastard!

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:37.810
You're Gije Zaral of the Buff Clan!

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:39.770
Why are you here?!

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.270
I was saved by Sheryl...

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.510
Karala! Stop it!

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:02.790
He's one of the Buff Clan!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.590
He's Gije Zaral of the Buff Clan!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:07.100
He deserves to be executed!

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:13.720
What's wrong with you all?!

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.480
He said it himself.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:18.400
He fought against us!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:20.550
He was our worst enemy!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:26.080
And yet he's asking his enemies to forgive
 him, like he has no shame at all!?

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:27.990
Isn't it obvious that he deserves to die?!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.840
I don't care what you say about me.

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:33.830
Whatever happens when the Ide's power is released...

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.410
I need to see that.

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.880
Die! You should kill yourself!

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.360
I don't care if you laugh at me.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.740
Let me live until the Ide manifests itself again.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:49.010
That's the sort of enemy you've been to me.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:53.460
The Ide appears by the power of the righteous.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.720
That's what the legend says.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.270
But...

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:01.600
What about our hatred for you?

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.920
We can't make our hatred and sadness disappear,

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:09.680
and we feel the same pain and misery as you.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:12.790
I'm sorry...

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:16.290
But...

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:21.600
I don't know how to make up for what I've done.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:54.720
The Solo Ship gets permission from
the Earth Union Military to land.

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.190
However, they discover that Bes'
 parents are being held captive.

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:04.160
The Earth Union Military demands the Solo
 Ship to make an exchange for the hostages.

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.360
Karala goes to rescue the hostages together with Gije.

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:12.090
Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:

